eason game","description":"From Kyle Williams to K.J. Britt, here are the players whose performances should have them ascending the Patriots' ranks.","published":"2026-08-16T11:29:46.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/nfl/story/_/id/49622601/new-england-patriots-preseason-risers-game","type":"Story","byline":"Mike Reiss","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Does Patriots' rookie TE Eli Raridon have untapped potential?","description":"The third-round draft pick was the ninth tight end taken in a historic draft at the position.","published":"2026-05-10T13:43:21.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/nfl/story/_/id/48713940/does-new-england-patriots-rookie-te-eli-raridon-untapped-potential","type":"Story","byline":"Mike Reiss","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Patriots 2026 free agency tracker: Offseason moves, signings","description":"Keep track of all the Patriots' moves throughout the 2026 offseason, including free agent signings, contracts and more.","published":"2026-03-23T22:17:45.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/nfl/story/_/id/48084019/new-england-patriots-2026-free-agency-tracker-offseason-moves-signings-contract-trades","type":"Story","byline":"Mike Reiss","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Dolphins 2025 free agency tracker: Offseason moves, signings","description":"Keep track of all the Dolphins' free agent moves throughout the 2025 offseason.","published":"2025-03-20T14:57:41.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/nfl/story/_/id/43937472/dolphins-2025-free-agency-tracker-offseason-moves-signings","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"New faces in new places: Bucs defense will look different","description":"Some of the mainstays that helped lift the Bucs to the Super Bowl in the 2020 season are no longer in Tampa Bay.","published":"2024-08-14T10:00:10.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/nfl/story/_/id/40847030/tampa-bay-buccaneers-new-faces-defense","type":"Story","byline":"Jenna Laine","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Ranking top NFL prospects: Best under-the-radar players","description":"We ranked the under-the-radar NFL players who could break out in 2024. How do Hendon Hooker and De'Von Achane stack up?","published":"2024-07-24T15:13:02.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/nfl/insider/story/_/id/40613137/nfl-prospects-2024-young-players-breakout-candidates","type":"Story","byline":"Aaron Schatz","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Why the Bucs didn't address certain holes on their roster","description":"Tampa Bay is confident that some of the guys on its roster are ready to play bigger roles.","published":"2024-05-09T14:10:07.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/nfl/story/_/id/40106294/tampa-bay-buccaneers-2024-roster-holes-answers","type":"Story","byline":"Jenna Laine","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Hurt Bucs Carlton Davis, Will Gholston out against Packers","description":"Injured Buccaneers Carlton Davis and Will Gholston are out against the Packers this week.","published":"2023-12-15T20:53:06.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/nfl/story/_/id/39120263/hurt-buccaneers-carlton-davis-gholston-packers","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Jenna Laine","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Tampa Bay Buccaneers NFL draft picks 2021: Analysis for every selection","description":"After taking the best player available in Round 1 with LB Joe Tryon, the Bucs drafted a possible heir to Tom Brady in QB Kyle Trask in Round 2.","published":"2021-04-26T19:02:35.000+00:00","url":"http://espn.com/blog/tampa-bay-buccaneers/post/_/id/24854/tampa-bay-buccaneers-nfl-draft-picks-2021-analysis-for-every-selection","type":"BlogEntry","byline":"Jenna Laine","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Auburn Tigers All-SEC linebacker K.J. Britt to undergo thumb surgery","description":"Linebacker K.J. Britt, who leads Auburn with 23 tackles through two games, will undergo thumb surgery on Friday, a team spokesperson said. It's unclear as to how long Britt will be sidelined.","published":"2024-01-23T15:43:09.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/30072900/auburn-tigers-all-sec-linebacker-kj-britt-undergo-thumb-surgery","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"}],"wiki":{"title":"K. J. Britt","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/K._J._Britt","description":"American football player (born 1999)","touched":"2026-11-16T23:42:38Z","intro":"K. J. Britt (born June 4, 1999) is an American professional football linebacker for the Detroit Lions of the National Football League (NFL). He played college football for the Auburn Tigers. Britt was selected by the Tampa Bay Buccaneers in the fifth round of the 2021 NFL Draft.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Britt attended Oxford High School. He was the number 299th ranked recruit in the country and the number 14th ranked inside linebacker. Britt committed to Auburn over offers from Ole Miss and Georgia."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"While at Auburn, Britt received minimal playing time as a freshman and served as a rotational piece as a sophomore recording 21 total tackles. In 2019 as a junior he broke out, recording 68 total tackled and was awarded All-Southeastern Conference First-team honors. As a senior, Britt missed all but two games due to a thumb injury."},{"key":"career","title":"Professional career","text":"TAMPA BAY BUCCANEERS\nBritt was selected by the Tampa Bay Buccaneers in the fifth round, 176th overall, of the 2021 NFL draft. He signed his four-year rookie contract on May 13, 2021.\nOn October 25, 2022, Britt was placed on injured reserve. He was activated on December 10.\n\nMIAMI DOLPHINS\nOn March 17, 2025, Britt signed a one-year contract with the Miami Dolphins.\n\nNEW ENGLAND PATRIOTS\nOn March 16, 2026, Britt signed a one-year, $1.4 million contract with the New England Patriots. On August 31, he was released by New England. On September 1, the Patriots re–signed Britt to their practice squad.\n\nDETROIT LIONS\nOn November 2, 2026, Britt was signed to the Detroit Lions active roster from the New England Patriots practice squad."}],"social":{}},"transactions":[{"date":"2026-11-04","text":"Signed LB K.J. Britt from New England's practice squad and LB Joe Bachie from the practice squad to the active roster. Signed LB Owen Pappoe to the practice squad."}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/nfl/player/_/id/4242521","pfr":"https://www.pro-football-reference.com/players/B/BritKJ00.htm","pff":"https://www.pff.com/nfl/players/kj-britt/57727","otc":"https://overthecap.com/player/kj-britt/9640","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/K._J._Britt"},"insights":["2026 cap number of $597K is the 57th-largest on the roster.","Contract expires after this season.","Drafted 176th overall in 2021 (round 5) by TB."]}